    "识别精度": "Accuracy",
    "标准版每天 500 次免费；高精度更准更慢，且要在百度控制台开通付费 —— 软件不会偷偷替你降档": "Standard includes 500 free calls per day; high accuracy is more precise but slower and must be enabled (paid) in the Baidu console. Quick Search never silently downgrades you.",
    "标准（免费）": "Standard (free)",
    "高精度（付费）": "High accuracy (paid)",
    "开始框选识别": "Start selecting",
    "测试当前引擎": "Test current engine",
    "一键诊断": "Quick diagnose",
