    "每次打开软件时自动检查新版本；发现新版会提示你下载。 取消勾选后不再自动检查（仍可点右边的「检查更新」）。": "Check for a new version every time Quick Search starts and prompt you to download it. Uncheck to stop checking automatically (Check for updates still works).",
    "自动更新 每次打开软件时自动检查新版本；发现新版会提示你下载。 取消勾选后不再自动检查（仍可点右边的「检查更新」）。": "Automatic updates — check for a new version every time Quick Search starts and prompt you to download it. Uncheck to stop checking automatically (Check for updates still works).",
