    "60 次/小时": "60/hour",
    "5000 次/小时": "5000/hour",
    "程序内自动下载": "In-app download",
    "填了之后所有 GitHub 请求都会带上它：接口额度从 60 次/小时 提到 5000 次/小时，也只有填了才走程序内自动下载；留空时 —— 不管是启动时自动检查到的，还是点「检查更新」查到的 —— 都只提示有新版本并给出下载链接，不会自动下载。只需要公开仓库的读取权限； 令牌只存在本机加密配置里，不会上传、不会写进日志。": "When filled in, all GitHub requests carry it: the API quota rises from 60 to 5000 requests per hour. Only public-repository read access is needed. The token is stored only in the encrypted local config — never uploaded, never logged.",
    "检查更新": "Check for updates",
    "在网页上查看 ↗": "View on GitHub ↗",
    "GitHub 下载链接": "GitHub download link",
    "✔ 新版本已经装好。点「立即重启」即可用上新版（不点也不会丢，下次开程序就是新版）。": "✔ The new version is installed. Click Restart now to use it (nothing is lost if you wait — it starts with the next launch).",
    "使用的工具": "Built with",
    "更新日志只记大功能，小修小补不占地方": "The changelog only lists major features",
    "「液态玻璃」横条样式的折射 / 色差由 WebView2 里的 WebGL2 着色器实时渲染， 抓的是横条背后那块真实桌面。它需要系统支持 WebGL2 —— 不支持时自动退回磨砂效果， 功能不受影响；开了「实时折射」后横条会对抓屏隐身（截图 / 录屏里看不到横条）， 这是无闪烁持续刷新的代价，关闭实时折射即恢复参与抓屏。": "The refraction and aberration of the liquid glass style are rendered in real time by a WebGL2 shader inside WebView2, using the actual desktop behind the bar. WebGL2 is required; without it the bar falls back to frosted and everything still works. With Live refraction on, the bar is hidden from screen capture (it does not appear in screenshots or recordings) — that is the price of flicker-free continuous refresh; turn it off to be captured again.",
    "图标被换到 %APPDATA%\\QuickSearch\\icons\\，配置存在 %APPDATA%\\QuickSearch\\config.json。": "Custom icons are stored in %APPDATA%\\QuickSearch\\icons\\, settings in %APPDATA%\\QuickSearch\\config.json.",
    "从云端恢复之前会自动在本机留一份 config.before-webdav(时间).QuickSearch 快照。": "Before restoring from the cloud, a config.before-webdav(timestamp).QuickSearch snapshot is saved locally.",
    "分享给别人是安全的": "Safe to share",
    "分享给别人是安全的：软件本体里不含任何账号信息 —— OCR 的 API Key / Secret Key、WebDAV 的账号密码都只写在本机那份 config.json 里，跟着配置走、不跟着软件走。 对方拿到的是一份「干净」的程序，第一次打开时各项凭据都是空的。": "Safe to share: the executable contains no account information. OCR API keys and WebDAV credentials live only in your local config.json, so they travel with your settings, not with the app. Whoever receives it gets a clean copy with every credential empty.",
    "想退出软件：右键托盘图标 → 退出。设置页不再放退出按钮 （没有账号体系，「退出」纯属多余入口）。": "To quit: right-click the tray icon → Quit. There is no Quit button here — without accounts it would be a redundant entry point.",
    "第一次用？切到「帮助」页，从第一条开始看。": "New here? Open the Help tab and start from the first item.",
