    "· 值越大越糊，0 = 不模糊；磨砂只负责「糊」，不改透明度": "· Higher means blurrier; 0 = no blur. Blur only blurs — it never touches opacity.",
    "‰ · 横条边缘处背景被扭曲的程度。太小看不出\"厚玻璃\"，太大会让边缘的文字糊成一团": "‰ · How much the background is bent at the bar's edges. Too little and it doesn't read as thick glass; too much and text near the edges smears.",
    "‰ · 模拟玻璃有多厚：越大，边缘处的背景被放大得越厉害": "‰ · Simulated glass thickness: the higher it is, the more the background is magnified at the edges.",
    "松手后等这么久才弹，调大可避免还在拖选时就冒出来 · 当前": "Wait this long before it pops up — raise it and the bar won't appear while you're still dragging · now ",
    "指针离弹出位置超过这么远，说明这条你不需要了 —— 立刻收起 · 0 = 不收起 · 当前": "If the pointer goes farther than this, you clearly don't need it — hide right away · 0 = never hide · now ",
    "横条弹出后，这么久没有任何操作（指针没移上来、没点、没按键、面板也没开）就自己收起来 · 0 = 不收起 · 当前": "Once the bar is up, hide it after this long with no activity (pointer didn't come up, no click, no key press, no panel opened) · 0 = never hide · now ",
