    "把因为排版被断开的行接回一段（PDF、窄栏复制最常见）；句末标点结尾、列表、编号、表格的换行不动": "Re-join lines that wrapping split apart (most common with PDFs and narrow columns); lines ending in punctuation, list items, numbered lines, and tables are left alone",
    "全角字母数字与标点收成半角（Ａ→A、１２３→123、（→(、，→,）；中文标点。、《》保持原样": "Fold full-width letters, digits, and punctuation to half-width (Ａ→A, １２３→123, （→(, ，→,); Chinese punctuation such as 。、《》 is left as it is",
