        "已添加「": "Added “",
        "打不开：": "Couldn't open: ",
        "（键": "(key ",
        "恢复失败：": "Restore failed: ",
        "清理失败：": "Cleanup failed: ",
        "扫描失败：": "Scan failed: ",
        "已加入列表：": "Added to the list: ",
        "失败：": "Failed: ",
        "正在诊断并实测「": "Diagnosing and measuring “",
